lex survey designs was used to conduct all analyses.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Cochran-Mantel-Haenszel chi-squared for trends\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Data are suppressed if relative standard error >0.3 or sample size <50.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Because of small sample sizes, some categories of demographic characteristics and counts of health-related behaviors were collapsed\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}